@startuml OctoTify_Class_Sender

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 60

title OctoTify 类图（6/6）—— Sender 策略模式

package "internal/sender (推送策略层)" {

    interface "Sender (推送发送器接口)" as Sender <<interface>> {
        + Send(ctx context.Context, config datatypes.JSON, title string, content string) error ' 发送消息到渠道
    }

    class "SenderFactory (发送器工厂)" as SenderFactory <<struct>> {
        - senders: map[string]Sender ' 渠道类型→发送器映射
        + Create(channelType string): (Sender, error) ' 根据渠道类型创建发送器
    }

    class "WechatSender (微信推送)" as WechatSender <<struct>> {
        + Send(ctx context.Context, config datatypes.JSON, title string, content string): error ' 调用微信API推送
    }
    class "TelegramSender (Telegram推送)" as TelegramSender <<struct>> {
        + Send(ctx context.Context, config datatypes.JSON, title string, content string): error ' 调用Telegram Bot API推送
    }
    class "DingtalkSender (钉钉推送)" as DingtalkSender <<struct>> {
        + Send(ctx context.Context, config datatypes.JSON, title string, content string): error ' 调用钉钉机器人API推送
    }
    class "EmailSender (邮件推送)" as EmailSender <<struct>> {
        + Send(ctx context.Context, config datatypes.JSON, title string, content string): error ' 调用SMTP发送邮件
    }
    class "WebhookSender (Webhook推送)" as WebhookSender <<struct>> {
        + Send(ctx context.Context, config datatypes.JSON, title string, content string): error ' 发送HTTP POST到自定义URL
    }
    class "FeishuSender (飞书推送)" as FeishuSender <<struct>> {
        + Send(ctx context.Context, config datatypes.JSON, title string, content string): error ' 调用飞书自定义机器人Webhook推送
    }
}

WechatSender ..|> Sender : 实现
TelegramSender ..|> Sender : 实现
DingtalkSender ..|> Sender : 实现
EmailSender ..|> Sender : 实现
WebhookSender ..|> Sender : 实现
FeishuSender ..|> Sender : 实现
SenderFactory --> Sender : 创建

note as SenderNote
    设计模式：
    - 策略模式：Sender 接口统一推送行为
    - 工厂模式：SenderFactory 根据 channel.Type 路由

    channel.Type → Sender 映射：
    "wechat"    → WechatSender
    "telegram"  → TelegramSender
    "dingtalk"  → DingtalkSender
    "email"     → EmailSender
    "webhook"   → WebhookSender
    "feishu"    → FeishuSender

    FeishuSender 配置结构：
    {
      "webhook_url": "https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/bot/v2/hook/xxx",
      "secret": ""  // 可选，签名校验密钥
    }

    签名校验流程：
    1. 拼接字符串: timestamp + "\n" + secret
    2. HMAC-SHA256 计算签名
    3. Base64 URL Safe 编码
    4. 附加到 URL: ?timestamp=xxx&sign=xxx

    并发推送策略：
    - goroutine pool 限制最大并发数（默认 10）
    - context.WithTimeout 单渠道超时 30s
    - errgroup 收集所有 goroutine 结果
    - 单渠道失败不影响其他渠道
end note

@enduml
